    "Name": "Neutron NT-5801",
    "Details": "The Neutron NT-5801 is an attempt to make a SLDF Royals worthy variant, but it never saw actual incorporation into those divisions. It upgrades the two arm mounted medium pulse lasers to large ones and adds an Ultra AC/5 in the right torso. To fit this all other lasers, three double heat sinks and the C.A.S.E. protection was removed, as well as switching to an Endo Steel structure.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Gauss</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.16</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
